      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استوعرهُ</span></b>  <i>He found it,</i> (S, Msb,) or <i>deemed
it,</i> (K,) namely a place, (Msb,) or a road, (A,
K,) or a thing, (S, Sgh,) <i>rugged,</i> (S, * K,) or <i>difficult;</i> (Msb;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوعرهُ</span></b> . (Sgh, K.)

